# Android release deobfuscation

Release builds (EAS production AAB and `npm run build:apk:local`) must run R8.

## Required

- `expo-build-properties` → `android.enableMinifyInReleaseBuilds: true` in `apps/app/app.json`
- `apps/app/app.config.js` must keep that flag when it rewrites the plugin
- `android.enableMinifyInReleaseBuilds=true` in `android/gradle.properties` after prebuild

`minifyEnabled` in `android/app/build.gradle` already reads that property. With Android Gradle Plugin 4.1+, the release bundle includes `BUNDLE-METADATA/com.android.tools.build.obfuscation/proguard.map`. Play Console picks that file up. Do not upload a separate empty mapping file.

## Do not

- Set `enableMinifyInReleaseBuilds` to `false` to silence a build
- Remove `proguard-rules.pro` keep rules for Reanimated and React Native TurboModules
- Enable `enableShrinkResourcesInReleaseBuilds` unless minify stays on and a release build has been installed and exercised on a device
